                            <comment id="16442284" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 18 Apr 2018 11:00:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We need to fix:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Keep extracted methods on old bean interface to preserve binary compatibility&lt;br/&gt;
2) add &lt;tt&gt;getCoordinatorFormatted&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;getLocalNodeFormatted&lt;/tt&gt; methods&lt;br/&gt;
3) move &lt;tt&gt;getNodesLeft&lt;/tt&gt; method on common discovery bean&lt;br/&gt;
4) Deprecate old &lt;tt&gt;getCoordinator&lt;/tt&gt; method&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16442532" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 18 Apr 2018 13:51:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I am a bit surprised that ZK discovery does not fire NODE_LEFT events, should we add it?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16444006" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 19 Apr 2018 12:47:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master and ignite-2.5&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
